{"operations":[{"content":"# Summary\n\nThe agreement's allocation rule for plots is: \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\" [[cite:obs-4d6b2807cc832ea006084f1200726686f3f6f0b7 \"Plots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n\nThe agreement does not specify the size of a plot. [[cite:obs-4d6b2807cc832ea006084f1200726686f3f6f0b7 \"# Garden agreement\n\n## Plots\n\nPlots are allocated to members as listed in the register of this agreement.\"]]\n","expected_sha256":"eaf7573831e7f400949eaf346e887aeb4ce1d51087d65f408972b8ea7678385f","kind":"modify","path":"doc/summary.md"}],"rationale":"Added the allocation rule verbatim from the agreement and stated that plot size is not specified, each supported by the agreement text."}